  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy (0.652970). This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to this strong RNA-only baseline, using the same transformer aggregation and concat fusion. It isolates the effect of multimodal integration, which is critical for determining if combining RNA and image data improves performance. This balances exploitation of the top RNA-only setup with exploration of multimodal potential, addressing a key design choice with minimal additional complexity."
}

